<title>USA: American HomePatient acquires 4 companies.</title>
<headline>American HomePatient acquires 4 companies.</headline>
<dateline>BRENTWOOD, Tenn. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>American HomePatient on Thursday said it acquired four home health-care companies.</p>
<p>The companies are Breathing Equipment Inc in Hazelton, Pennsylvania; Home Medical Options of Camilla, Georgia; Schofield Medical Services Inc in Florence, Alabama, and Paramedical Specialties Inc in Rockledge, Florida.</p>
<p>The four companies operate a total of seven home health-care centers and generate annual revenues of about $5.6 million.</p>
<p>American HomePatient said the acquisitions would enable the company to provide broader geographic coverage in five states -- Pennsylvania, Florida, Mississippi, Georgia and Alabama.</p>
